-- src:2817 | amend includes—
-- src:2818 | (a) for an Act or statutory instrument—omit, insert, substitute, renumber or relocate a provision of the Act or instrument; and
-- src:2819 | (b) for an Act or statutory instrument (or a provision of it)—amend by implication; and
-- src:2820 | (c) for a provision of an Act or statutory instrument—omit the provision (or a part of it), substitute another provision for the provision (or a part of it), renumber the provision (or a part of it) or relocate the provision (or a part of it); and
-- src:2821 | (d) for any other instrument, a provision of an instrument or a decision—change or alter.
@ref dictionary pt 1, amend (src:2817-2821)
GIVETH A `Definition`
`dictionary pt 1: amend` MEANS
    `Definition` WITH
        `term` IS "amend"
        `how it is defined` IS `includes`
        `applies to` IS "all Acts and statutory instruments (dictionary, part 1)"
        `meaning as printed` IS "amend includes—"
        `further lines as printed` IS LIST ("(a) for an Act or statutory instrument—omit, insert, substitute, renumber or relocate a provision of the Act or instrument; and"), ("(b) for an Act or statutory instrument (or a provision of it)—amend by implication; and"), ("(c) for a provision of an Act or statutory instrument—omit the provision (or a part of it), substitute another provision for the provision (or a part of it), renumber the provision (or a part of it) or relocate the provision (or a part of it); and"), ("(d) for any other instrument, a provision of an instrument or a decision—change or alter.")

