        `applies to` IS "all Acts and statutory instruments (dictionary, part 1)"
        `meaning as printed` IS "land includes messuages, tenements and hereditaments, corporeal or incorporeal, of any tenure or description, whatever the interest in the land."
        `further lines as printed` IS EMPTY

